@startuml UML类图_治理
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #F7FAFC
  BorderColor #4A5568
}
hide circle
left to right direction

class Account <<reference>> {
  - id: String
  - name: String
}
class Activity <<reference>> {
  - id: String
  - name: String
}
class Admin <<reference>> {
  - id: String
  - name: String
}

class Report {
  - id: String
  - reason: String
  - status: ReportStatus
  - result: String
  - handledAt: DateTime
  + resolve(adminId, result)
  + dismiss(adminId)
}
class Notification {
  - id: String
  - type: NotificationType
  - content: String
  - isRead: boolean
  - createdAt: DateTime
  + markRead()
}
class AuditLog {
  - id: String
  - objectType: String
  - objectId: String
  - action: String
  - beforeStatus: String
  - afterStatus: String
  - description: String
  - operatedAt: DateTime
  + append(...)
}

enum ReportStatus {
  PENDING
  RESOLVED
  DISMISSED
}
enum NotificationType {
  REVIEW_RESULT
  ACTIVITY_CHANGED
  WAITLIST_PROMOTED
  FORCE_REFUND
}

Account "1" -- "*" Report : 提交
Activity "1" -- "*" Report : 被举报
Admin "0..1" -- "*" Report : 处理
Account "1" -- "*" Notification : 接收
Account "0..1" -- "*" AuditLog : 操作人

note right of AuditLog
  审计对象用 objectType + objectId 关联，
  不直接连到所有业务类，避免图过密。
end note

legend bottom
  本图与 UML类图.puml 共同构成类模型。
  Account、Activity、Admin 只画引用信息，完整定义见核心业务类图。
  Report/Notification/AuditLog 的完整字段见 类图说明.md 与数据库映射。
endlegend
@enduml
